.Language=English,English
.PluginContents=Windows Explorer context menu

@Contents
$ #Windows Explorer context menu#
    This command allows you to execute command from
Windows Explorer context menu.

    ~EMENU configuration~@Configure@

@Configure
$ #Configuration#
    Select this option if you want EMENU to show message box after EMENU
finished its work

@Close
$ #Press "OK" to continue...#

    For some obscure reason certain commands can not be executed in parallel
with FAR. This is especially noticeable on Win95/98 and almost never happens
on Windows NT. Don't press #OK# until such command returns. (Don't
ask me for more reasonable explanation - I don't understand this myself)

    You can turn this option on and off from ~EMENU configuration~@Configure@
